/* Help window */
"EZ Exif Help" = "EZ Exif 帮助";
"A guide to editing metadata on scanned film photos." = "编辑扫描胶片照片元数据的指南。";
"Getting Started" = "快速上手";
"**Open** (⌘O) a photo, or drag files or a whole folder onto the window. A dragged/imported folder's photos are grouped into a folder in the sidebar, subfolders and all — expand a subfolder to see (and load) what's inside it." = "**打开**（⌘O）一张照片，或者把文件、整个文件夹拖到窗口里。拖入/导入的文件夹里的照片会在侧边栏中归入对应的文件夹，子文件夹也一样——展开子文件夹即可查看（并加载）其中的内容。";
"Select one photo to edit its fields individually, or select several to edit shared fields across all of them at once." = "选中一张照片可以单独编辑它的字段；选中多张照片则可以同时编辑它们共有的字段。";
"Right-click a photo (or a whole folder) in the sidebar to remove it from the list or reload it from disk — a folder's menu acts on every photo inside it, including its subfolders." = "在侧边栏中右键点击一张照片（或整个文件夹），可以将其从列表中移除，或从磁盘重新加载——对文件夹执行操作会作用于其中的所有照片，包括子文件夹里的。";
"Supported formats: JPEG, TIFF, PNG, and HEIC." = "支持的格式：JPEG、TIFF、PNG 和 HEIC。";
"Editing Fields" = "编辑字段";
"Fields are grouped into sections — Basics, File, Photographer & Copyright, Camera & Lens, Film, Roll, Development, Lab, Scanning, and Notes. See the Field Reference below for what each one means." = "字段按区块分组——基本信息、文件、摄影师与版权、相机与镜头、胶片、卷、冲洗、冲印店、扫描，以及备注。每个字段的具体含义见下方的字段参考表。";
"Each section header has a “×” button that clears every field **currently shown** in that section — a field you've hidden is never touched." = "每个区块的标题栏都有一个“×”按钮，用于清空该区块中**当前显示**的所有字段——被隐藏的字段不受影响。";
"Setting **File Source** to “Digital Still Camera” disables Scanning; setting **Is Film Photo** to “No” disables Film, Roll, Development, and Lab — since those stop being relevant." = "把**文件来源**设为“数码相机”会禁用扫描区块；把**是否为胶片照片**设为“否”会禁用胶片、卷、冲洗和冲印店区块——因为这些字段已不再适用。";
"An orange dot next to a field (or a photo's thumbnail) means it has unsaved changes." = "字段（或照片缩略图）旁边的橙色圆点表示有未保存的更改。";
"With several photos selected, a field left blank shows the value they all already share as a placeholder — type over it to set that value for the whole selection, or leave it as-is to keep each photo's own." = "选中多张照片时，如果某个字段留空，会以占位符的形式显示它们共有的值——直接输入即可将该值应用到整个选区，保持留空则各照片仍保留各自原有的值。";
"The rotate button (⟳) above the sidebar preview turns the selected photo 90° at a time without touching its pixel data, the same lossless rotation any photo viewer uses — an orange dot appears next to it until saved, and it's covered by Undo/Revert like any other edit." = "侧边栏预览图上方的旋转按钮（⟳）每次将选中的照片旋转 90°，不会改动像素数据本身，和任何看图软件的无损旋转原理一样——保存前旁边会显示橙色圆点，也和其他编辑一样受“撤销”/“还原”控制。";
"The Location map picker has zoom buttons and a place search box, alongside the usual click-to-drop-pin and “Use Current Location.”" = "位置字段的地图选择器新增了缩放按钮和地点搜索框，此外还保留了原有的点击放置图钉和“使用当前位置”功能。";
"Customizing What You See" = "自定义显示内容";
"Settings → Fields lets you show or hide any field — hiding one never changes its stored value, it just declutters the editor." = "在“设置 → 字段”中可以显示或隐藏任意字段——隐藏字段不会改变它已存储的值，只是让编辑界面更简洁。";
"Development Temperature and Aperture each have their own display-format toggle (°C/°F; plain number vs. “f/2.8”) right next to their visibility switch." = "冲洗温度和光圈各自都有独立的显示格式开关（摄氏度/华氏度；纯数字 vs. “f/2.8”），就在它们各自的显示/隐藏开关旁边。";
"Presets" = "预设";
"Save reusable Photographer, Shooting Parameters, Camera, Lens, Film, Development, Lab, or Scanning presets from the panel on the right (toggle it with the sidebar icon in the toolbar), and apply one with a single click." = "可以在右侧面板（用工具栏上的侧边栏图标切换显示）中保存可重复使用的摄影师、拍摄参数、相机、镜头、胶片、冲洗、冲印店或扫描预设，点一下即可套用。";
"Right-click a preset in Settings → Presets to rename or delete it." = "在“设置 → 预设”中右键点击某个预设，可以重命名或删除它。";
"A Shooting Parameters preset covers ISO, Aperture, Shutter Speed, Exposure Bias, Exposure Program, White Balance, and Metering Mode by default; 35mm Equivalent Focal Length can be added to it as well." = "拍摄参数预设默认包含 ISO、光圈、快门速度、曝光补偿、曝光模式、白平衡和测光模式；35 mm 等效焦距也可以添加进去。";
"Choosing a Film preset's Manufacturer and Name from the built-in film stock database automatically fills in Film Type, Film ISO, and Process." = "在胶片预设中从内置胶片数据库选择厂商和名称，会自动填充胶片类型、胶片 ISO 和冲洗工艺。";
"Applying a preset skips any field whose section is currently disabled (see File Source/Is Film Photo above), the same as if you'd typed into it by hand." = "套用预设时，会跳过所有当前被禁用区块中的字段（参见上文的文件来源/是否为胶片照片），效果和你手动输入时一样。";
"Settings → General → Defaults can apply a Shooting Parameters, Camera, Lens, or Film preset to every new import automatically — each one (and Photographer/Copyright) has its own on/off switch, and a preset only lands if every field it covers is still empty, so real EXIF data already in a file is never overwritten." = "“设置 → 通用 → 默认值”可以为每次新导入的照片自动套用拍摄参数、相机、镜头或胶片预设——每一项（以及摄影师/版权）都有自己独立的开关，并且只有当该预设涉及的所有字段都仍为空时才会套用，因此文件中已有的真实 EXIF 数据永远不会被覆盖。";
"Saving" = "保存";
"**Save** (⌘S) writes one photo's metadata back into the file itself. **Save All** (toolbar) does the same for every photo with unsaved changes." = "**保存**（⌘S）会把一张照片的元数据写回文件本身。**全部保存**（工具栏）会对所有有未保存更改的照片执行同样的操作。";
"Settings → Saving keeps a `.bak` backup of the original before overwriting it by default (toggle it off there), or can save edited copies to a separate folder instead of touching the originals." = "默认情况下，“设置 → 保存”会在覆盖原文件之前保留一份 `.bak` 备份（可在那里关闭这项功能），也可以改为把编辑后的副本保存到单独的文件夹，不动原文件。";
"Settings → Saving also has an Image Save Quality slider (Low to High, 7 steps) — every save re-encodes the image, so a lower step trades some quality for a smaller file, while the default (High) stays as close to the original as a re-encode can get. Only matters for lossy formats (JPEG, HEIC); TIFF and PNG ignore it since they're lossless." = "“设置 → 保存”里还有一个图片保存质量滑块（低到高，共 7 档）——每次保存都会重新编码图像，档位越低文件越小但画质也会相应降低，默认档位（高）会尽量贴近原图，这是重新编码所能达到的最接近原图的效果。这项设置只对有损格式（JPEG、HEIC）有意义，TIFF 和 PNG 是无损格式，会忽略此设置。";
"**Undo** (⌘Z) steps back one field-edit at a time; applying a preset or using Revert counts as a single undo step." = "**撤销**（⌘Z）每次后退一步字段编辑；套用预设或使用“还原”都算作一次撤销步骤。";
"Compatibility" = "兼容性";
"Camera, lens, and capture info are mirrored into standard EXIF tags any photo app can read." = "相机、镜头和拍摄信息会同步写入标准 EXIF 标签，任何看图软件都能读取。";
"Film-specific fields (stock, development, lab, scanner) are also mirrored into the original AnalogExif namespace, so AnalogExif-aware tools can read them too." = "胶片相关的专属字段（胶片型号、冲洗、冲印店、扫描仪）也会同步写入原始 AnalogExif 命名空间，支持 AnalogExif 的工具同样可以读取。";
"Opening a file already tagged by AnalogExif, a RetroExif-style tool, or Microsoft's lens-info schema is supported — their data shows up instead of appearing blank." = "打开已经被 AnalogExif、RetroExif 类工具或 Microsoft 镜头信息架构标记过的文件也是支持的——它们的数据会正常显示，而不是显示为空。";
"Field Reference" = "字段参考";
"What every editable field means, grouped the same way the editor groups them." = "每个可编辑字段的含义说明，分组方式与编辑器中的一致。";
"The ISO the shot was actually exposed at (standard EXIF) — can differ from the film's own box speed if pushed or pulled." = "实际拍摄时使用的 ISO（标准 EXIF）——如果进行了增感或减感冲洗，可能与胶片本身的标称感光度不同。";
"The f-stop the lens was set to." = "镜头设置的光圈值。";
"The exposure time, e.g. “1/125 s”." = "曝光时间，例如“1/125 s”。";
"Exposure compensation applied, in EV." = "所使用的曝光补偿量，单位为 EV。";
"The lens's focal length for this shot." = "这张照片所使用的镜头焦距。";
"The focal length re-expressed as its 35mm/full-frame equivalent — hidden by default." = "换算成 35 mm/全画幅等效值后的焦距——默认隐藏。";
